      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 30,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated dermatologists and clinical team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the dermatology specialists, including Dr. Kaplan, Dr. Boyd, Dr. Lancellotti, and Dr. Richman, for their thoroughness, patience, and attentive demeanor. Clients note that doctors listen to long health histories and review previous medical files before forming plans. One reviewer expressed strong dissatisfaction regarding staff responses to online reviews."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective relief for chronic conditions"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers describe significant clinical improvements in pets suffering from chronic ear infections, severe allergies, and complex dermatological conditions that other clinics failed to resolve. Owners highlight targeted diagnostics that identified root causes. However, two critical clients reported paying substantial fees without seeing positive changes in their pets' conditions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed care plans with mixed follow-ups"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the clinic for providing comprehensive written care plans and responsive email communication when questions arise during home treatment. Clinicians explain medical options in depth. At the same time, several dissatisfied reviewers cite communication breakdowns, including a lack of reminders before appointments and disputed no-show cancellation fees."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
