        "en": "Does the clinic specialize in pet dermatology and ear diseases?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the practice focuses specifically on veterinary dermatology, treating severe allergies, persistent ear infections, and skin disorders."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
